#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:1
msgid "显式时钟借用与浅睡眠"
msgstr "Explicit clock leases and shallow sleep"

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:3
msgid ""
"IO58 当前交付是静态 caller-owned 时钟接纳、排空屏障，以及 STM32F407 固定 RUN 配置下的一次浅睡眠。组件不创建全局 PM "
"注册表、任务、定时器、最大对象池或 默认状态。未显式选用的 `Nexus::ClockDomain` 是 `EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL` "
"静态目标；F4 的 sleep 源也须由显式可选目标引用。板卡不自动选 GPIO 唤醒或改变电气连接。"
msgstr ""
"IO58 provides static caller-owned clock admission, a drain barrier and one "
"shallow sleep under the fixed STM32F407 RUN configuration. The component "
"creates no global PM registry, task, timer, maximum-sized object pool or "
"default state. Unselected `Nexus::ClockDomain` is an `EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL` "
"static target; F4 sleep sources also need explicit optional-target "
"references. Boards do not automatically select GPIO wake or alter electrical "
"connections."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:8
msgid ""
"公共 API 使用 opaque `nx_clock_domain_t`，mutable storage / constructor 只供私有 "
"装配。消费者提供自然对齐、零初始化的 `nx_clock_lease_t`。接纳成功后，token 的对象 身份和存储被借用，字段由 provider "
"管理；复制字段不能释放原对象。每个 domain 的显式 capacity 为别名和 retained identity "
"扫描给出上限，不承诺与容量无关的常数时间。"
msgstr ""
"The public API uses opaque `nx_clock_domain_t`; mutable storage / "
"constructors are private assembly details. The consumer supplies a naturally "
"aligned, zero-initialized `nx_clock_lease_t`. Successful admission borrows "
"the token's identity and storage, with provider-managed fields; copying "
"fields cannot release the original object. Each domain's explicit capacity "
"bounds alias and retained-identity scans; no capacity-independent constant "
"time is promised."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:13
msgid ""
"生命周期的唯一 privileged Thread owner 调用 `close`，禁止新增 lease，再自行推动 "
"每个设备停止、DMA/IRQ/完成通知排空。消费者成功 detach 后才 release。close 本身 不取消设备，release "
"不证明外设已停止。现存 lease 不因超时、关闭或睡眠被撤回。 `quiescent` 仅在当前 closed epoch 且 count/list "
"同时为空时返回成功；reopen 只有在 排空后才能单调提升 admission epoch，最大值永久拒绝复用。旧控制值不能跨 epoch "
"重开或建立排空凭证。domain storage 的生命周期长于全部控制副本，禁止 memset 重置。"
msgstr ""
"The sole privileged Thread lifecycle owner calls `close` to prevent new "
"leases, then drives each device's stop and drains DMA/IRQ/completion "
"notifications itself. Consumers release only after successful detach. Close "
"does not cancel devices, and release does not prove a peripheral stopped. "
"Timeout, close or sleep never revoke existing leases. `quiescent` succeeds "
"only in the current closed epoch with both count and list empty. Reopen can "
"monotonically advance the admission epoch only after drain; the maximum "
"permanently rejects reuse. Old control values cannot reopen across epochs or "
"establish drain proof. Domain storage outlives all control copies; resetting "
"it with memset is prohibited."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:20
msgid ""
"metadata 保存恢复 incoming PRIMASK；Native 使用真实递归线程排他模型。acquire / release 可在 same-"
"CPU privileged Thread、PendSV、SysTick 或外部 configurable IRQ "
"使用；构造、close、quiescent、reopen 为 serialized privileged Thread。NMI、fault、 "
"SMP、signal 或其他安全域调用不在合同内。输出和 wake word 不能覆盖私有 provider、 retained token "
"或彼此；拒绝不能破坏已借用控制。没有回调或 token release 后的访问。"
msgstr ""
"Metadata saves/restores incoming PRIMASK; Native uses a real recursive "
"thread-exclusion model. Acquire / release may run in same-CPU privileged "
"Thread, PendSV, SysTick or external configurable IRQ; construction, close, "
"quiescent and reopen require serialized privileged Thread. NMI, fault, SMP, "
"signals and other security domains are outside the contract. Outputs and wake"
" words cannot overlap private provider state, retained tokens or each other; "
"rejection cannot corrupt already borrowed controls. There are no callbacks or"
" accesses after token release."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:26
msgid ""
"SoC sleep 在 incoming PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 全清的 privileged Thread 调用。 "
"同一个保存掩码下最终验证 closed barrier、真实寄存器固定配置和 wake sequence，再 进入既有生产 "
"`nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt`。WFI 保持 PRIMASK，已使能 IRQ 变为 pending "
"可以唤醒，恢复掩码后运行；返回后 owner 必须重检真实业务谓词。序列变化则成功返回 `slept=false`。SCR.SLEEPDEEP "
"已设置、STOP、动态 RUN 均明确拒绝；从不改写 SCR、 RCC、Flash、Tick、pending IRQ 或 deadline。32-bit "
"wake sequence 需要调用者证明 观察窗口内不会完整绕回；不声称用一个快照解决 DMA/NMI/SMP 发布或无界 ABA。"
msgstr ""
"SoC sleep runs in privileged Thread with incoming PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK "
"all clear. Under the same saved mask it finally verifies the closed barrier, "
"actual fixed register configuration and wake sequence, then enters production"
" `nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt`. WFI preserves PRIMASK; an enabled IRQ becoming"
" pending can wake it and runs after mask restoration. The owner must reread "
"the actual business predicate after return. A changed sequence returns "
"success with `slept=false`. Set SCR.SLEEPDEEP, STOP and dynamic RUN are "
"explicitly rejected; SCR, RCC, Flash, Tick, pending IRQs and deadlines are "
"never rewritten. A 32-bit wake sequence requires the caller to prove no "
"complete wrap within the observation window; one snapshot does not solve "
"DMA/NMI/SMP publication or unbounded ABA."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:34
msgid ""
"当前 F407 profile 为 nominal HSE8 MHz / M8 / N336 / P2 / Q7，SYSCLK/AHB168、 APB1 "
"42、APB2 84 MHz，Flash5WS，SSCG disabled。来源是锁定 F4 SDK 的 RCC 定义与 当前 system.c "
"固定启动值。晶振实际频率、供电、热漂移和板卡布局不能由 ready/divisor 读回测得，仍需物理验证。"
msgstr ""
"The current F407 profile is nominal HSE8 MHz / M8 / N336 / P2 / Q7, "
"SYSCLK/AHB168, APB1 42 and APB2 84 MHz, Flash5WS and SSCG disabled. Sources "
"are the locked F4 SDK RCC definitions and current fixed system.c startup "
"values. Ready/divisor readback cannot measure actual oscillator frequency, "
"supply, thermal drift or Board layout; physical verification remains "
"necessary."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:39
msgid ""
"owner 必须独占 RCC 决策，登记全部相关消费者，并提供实际 enabled wake IRQ；模块不 发现遗漏消费者或隐式暂停内核。实际 deep"
" STOP / PLL 改频扩展必须先排空，停止全部 Tick/time providers、scheduler deadline borrowers 与"
" IRQ，再由独占硬件端口实施有限 clock restore / rollback；clock/time 的新域需 cold 重建，旧绝对 "
"deadline 不可继承。 本切片没有实现这些扩展，不把 admission epoch 伪装成时间域转换。"
msgstr ""
"The owner must exclusively control RCC decisions, register all relevant "
"consumers and provide an actually enabled wake IRQ; this module discovers no "
"omitted consumers and never implicitly pauses a kernel. Actual deep STOP / "
"PLL frequency-change extensions must first drain and stop all Tick/time "
"providers, scheduler deadline borrowers and IRQs, then use an exclusive "
"hardware port for bounded clock restore / rollback. New clock/time domains "
"need cold reconstruction; old absolute deadlines cannot be inherited. This "
"slice does not implement these extensions or disguise an admission epoch as "
"time-domain conversion."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:45
msgid ""
"当前测试直接执行生产 domain、Native 排他和 F4 sleep C 实现，只替换 CPU context／ WFI 外部叶子。历史跨系列 "
"RED／GREEN 与测量记录保留原始身份，见 [固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design/clock-"
"domain-sleep.md)。 本次软件结果须由当前门禁重新建立；主机模型不建立 physical HIL、WCET 或功耗资格。"
msgstr ""
"Current tests execute production domain, Native exclusion and F4 sleep C "
"directly, replacing only external CPU-context/WFI leaves. Historical cross-"
"family RED/GREEN and measurement records retain their original identities at "
"the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design/clock-"
"domain-sleep.md). Current gates must establish this iteration's software "
"results afresh; host models establish no physical HIL, WCET or power "
"qualification."

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:50
msgid "当前范围"
msgstr "Current scope"

#: docs/design/clock-domain-sleep.md:52
msgid ""
"F4 只接纳当前明确维护的固定时钟和浅睡眠选择。原 H743 pause/resume 不属于 本轮生产 provider；ClockDomain "
"公共屏障不自动赋予 F4 DVFS、深 STOP 或运行期 外设恢复。历史实现按固定旧源码读取，当前模式以支持目录为准。"
msgstr ""
"F4 admits only the fixed-clock and shallow-sleep selections explicitly "
"maintained today. The original H743 pause/resume is outside this production "
"provider iteration. The public ClockDomain barrier does not automatically "
"grant F4 DVFS, deep STOP or runtime peripheral restoration. Read historical "
"implementations at their fixed prior source; use the support catalogue for "
"current modes."
